{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/abd71d8b85262e55e8c99bfbce0beb53.avif?t=1763773088\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras_big/abd71d8b85262e55e8c99bfbce0beb53.webp?t=1763773088 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>10-rats-in-a-trenchcoat roguelike deckbuilder</strong>. Recruit a rag-tag team of rats, craft a curated deck for each, and discover devastating multi-deck combos. Build your team &amp; masterfully pilot multiple unique decks to take down increasingly difficult enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/6971f991a14ae61a87dc1a63471e299c.avif?t=1763773088\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras_big/6971f991a14ae61a87dc1a63471e299c.webp?t=1763773088 width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team of small but clever companions each maintains their own deck. Every turn, you draw one card from each companion's deck, then play these cards in strategic combinations to outmaneuver increasingly dangerous opponents.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, visit the  shop to acquire new cards for your companions or recruit new allies. Each addition opens up fresh tactical possibilities and unexpected synergies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/a637ed6df031d55bced6fbc776376426.poster.avif?t=1763773088\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/a637ed6df031d55bced6fbc776376426.webm?t=1763773088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/a637ed6df031d55bced6fbc776376426.mp4?t=1763773088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/3da801eec27de2ed7e33bce00121fb1d.avif?t=1763773088\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras_big/3da801eec27de2ed7e33bce00121fb1d.webp?t=1763773088 width=1560 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Companions -\u00a0</strong>Discover powerful synergies as companions interact and evolve together. Each companion has its own card pools, personality, and strengths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Multi-Deckbuilding -\u00a0</strong>Master the art of crafting and piloting 5 distinct companion decks simultaneously, each performing a unique function on your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/077401eca132a39a7465d9ec5d4d4cfe.poster.avif?t=1763773088\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/077401eca132a39a7465d9ec5d4d4cfe.webm?t=1763773088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/077401eca132a39a7465d9ec5d4d4cfe.mp4?t=1763773088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_u